      "verdict": "accept",
      "rationale": "The variant fully adheres to the sustainability brief: all parts are rABS, no paint or coatings, mono-material, screw-free snap-fit closure, and repairable/recyclable. The form is a coherent chamfered slab with a single parting line and recessed display, matching the honest, warm aesthetic. CMF is excellent: undyed rABS with visible speckle and textured_light finish, no secondary cosmetic parts. Usability is good: top intake is unobstructed in normal use, display is readable, USB is reachable. Intent anchors are preserved in the structure: material, snap hooks, finish, wall thickness, chamfer, and vent are all realized. Minor deductions: form coherence slightly reduced by the many snap hooks and pry slots, but they are necessary for screw-free disassembly; usability slightly reduced because the front USB-C may be less convenient than side placement, but still acceptable. Overall, a strong sustainable design.",
